    "voice": "produce_events/201200411/2012004110010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012004110020,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "先日……買って参りました……\r\n疲れに効くと……評判でございましたので……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200411/2012004110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、すごく落ち着くよ──\r\n……しょ、と",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0152",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近、疲れてても眠れなかったりしてさ\r\n俺もお香を焚いてみようかな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012004110030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それは……\r\n心配で……ございます……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200411/2012004110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、いや、そんな深刻なものじゃないんだ\r\nお香があったら、ちょうどいいかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012004110040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "では……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200411/2012004110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012004110050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世が……\r\n昔話など……致しましょう……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200411/2012004110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、いや……気を遣ってもらうのは悪いよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、ちょっと面白そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012004110060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ふふ……\r\nそれでは……",
